config RP_BMI08X_STREAM
    bool "Use custom BMI08x stream files"
    default y
    depends on BMI08X
    depends on BMI08X_ACCEL_STREAM || BMI08X_GYRO_STREAM
    help
      Replace official bmi08x_accel_stream.c and bmi08x_gyro_stream.c
      with custom versions from this module.